,"title":"Mānasa Deho Geho"}}},"song":{"meta":{"page":169,"first_line":"bhajahu̐ re mana śrī-nanda-nandana","author":"Śrīla Govinda Dās Kavirāj"},"title":["Bhajahu̐ Re Mana"],"author":["by Śrīla Govinda Dās Kavirāj"],"verses":[{"number":"1","text":["bhajahu̐ re mana    śrī-nanda-nandana","    abhaya-charaṇāravinda re","dūrlabha mānava    janama sat-saṅge","    taroho e bhava-sindhu re"],"translation":["O mind, just worship the lotus feet of the son of Nanda, which make one fearless. Having obtained this rare human birth, cross over this ocean of worldly existence through the association of saintly persons."],"isLong":false},{"number":"2","text":["śīta ātapa    bāta bariṣaṇa","    e dina jāminī jāgi re","biphale sevinu    kṛpaṇa durajana","    chapala sukha-laba lāgi’ re"],"translation":["Both in the day and at night I remain sleepless, suffering the pains of the heat and cold, the wind and the rain. For a fraction of flickering happiness I have uselessly served wicked and miserly men."],"isLong":false},{"number":"3","text":["e dhana, jauvana,    putra, parijana","    ithe ki āche paratīti re","kamala-dala-jala,    jīvana ṭalamala","    bhajahu̐ hari-pada niti re"],"translation":["What assurance of real happiness is there in all of one’s wealth, youthfulness, sons, and family members? This life is tottering like a drop of water on a lotus petal; therefore you should always serve and worship the divine feet of Lord Hari."],"isLong":false},{"number":"4","text":["śravaṇa, kīrtana,    smaraṇa, vandana,","    pāda-sevana, dāsya re","pūjana, sakhī-jana,    ātma-nivedana","    govinda-dāsa-abhilāṣa re"],"translation":["It is the desire and great longing of Govinda dās to engage himself in the nine processes of bhakti, namely hearing the glories of Lord Hari and chanting those glories, constantly remembering Him and offering prayers to Him, serving the Lord’s lotus feet, serving the Supreme Lord as a servant, worshipping Him with flowers and incense and so forth, serving Him as a friend, and completely offering the Lord one’s very self."],"isLong":false}],"resources":{"audio":[{"title":"Srila B.S. Govinda Dev-Goswami Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/govinda-maharaj-bhajahu-re-1","personSlug":"srila-b-s-govinda-dev-goswami-maharaj"},{"title":"Srila B.S. Govinda Dev-Goswami Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/govinda-maharaj-bhajahu-re","personSlug":"srila-b-s-govinda-dev-goswami-maharaj"},{"title":"Srila B.K. Ashram Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/scsmathcolombia/13-bhajahu-re-mana","personSlug":"srila-b-k-ashram-maharaj"},{"title":"Manasa Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/huron/bhajahu-re-mana","personSlug":"manasa-krishna-prabhu"},{"title":"Bhakti Lalita Devi","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bhakti-lalita-devi/bhakti-lalita-devi-bhajahu-re-mana","personSlug":"bhakti-lalita-devi"},{"title":"Caracas temple","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/shchsm-karakas-bxadzhaxu-re","personSlug":"caracas-temple"}]},"hasWbw":false,"hasVersesText":true,"hasVersesTranslations":true,"hasLongVerses":false,"fullInlineWbw":false},"telegraphUrl":null},"head":{"canonical":"/en-2022/bhajahu-re-mana-shri-nanda-nandana/","description":"Bhajahu̐ Re Mana — a Vaiṣṇava song by Śrīla Govinda Dās Kavirāj with lyrics, English translation and word-by-word meaning. From Kirtan Guide.","title":"Bhajahu̐ Re Mana. by Śrīla Govinda Dās Kavirāj | Kirtan Site"},"kind":"song","route":{"kind":"item","bookId":"en-2022","slug":"bhajahu-re-mana-shri-nanda-nandana"}}